# A final vowel followed by an apostrophe stands for an accented vowel
# (perche' -> perché, citta' -> città). Real truncations (po', mo') are
# in the dictionary (find-supplement.py: final-apostrophe) and are matched
# first.
final-apostrophe
a' à final
e' è final
e' é final
i' ì final
o' ò final
u' ù final

# Paradigm checks for find-accent-misspellings.py: a plain form ending in
# the unaccented vowel is a real inflection when the stem plus one of these
# endings is a known word (collaboro/collaborò: collaborare; consenti/
# consentì: consentire; abilita/abilità: abilitare).
paradigm ò are ere ire
paradigm à are
paradigm ì ire ere are
paradigm é ere

# Word forms the list lacks (dictionary.h: isWordForm): typed, they stand;
# they are never suggested. An infinitive drops its final e before one or
# two clitic pronouns (fidarvi, impressionarle, farmelo, darglielo).
suffix mi ti si ci vi lo la li le ne gli after=r drop=e
suffix melo mela meli mele mene telo tela teli tele tene selo sela seli sele sene after=r drop=e
suffix celo cela celi cele cene velo vela veli vele vene glielo gliela glieli gliele gliene after=r drop=e
